{
 "encounter_id": "00970",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I want to lose weight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Tell me what's prompted that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Pants don't fit. Put on about twenty pounds this year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's a fair amount in a year. What do you think changed?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Desk job. New."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What did you do before?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Warehouse. On my feet. Now I'm at a desk, ten hours."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's quite a change. And how's your eating been? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Takeout. Lunch at my desk. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What about drinks, soda, juice? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Soda, two cans a day. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Let me ask about how you feel in yourself. Any shortness of breath when you climb stairs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other health conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High cholesterol. They told me last year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. I'm not going to give you a diet sheet. Let's start with two small changes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Like what? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "First, swap your two cans of soda for water, or sparkling water with lemon. That alone cuts over three hundred calories a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Hard, but okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Second, take a ten-minute walk after lunch. Away from the desk."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Every day, even in the rain. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Third, pack your lunch two days a week instead of buying it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Costs less, too. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exactly. Does that sound doable? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Weigh yourself once a week, same day, same time, same scale. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've got a scale. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. A pound a week is a healthy target. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you want me to explain anything else? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you haven't lost any weight in two months, come back and we'll talk about what else we can do."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Two months. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good luck. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thanks. ~"
  }
